      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w23.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "闘技場の再建は、驚く速さで進んでいた。壁が立ち、屋根が乗った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "客席の一列目が、戻った。復興選手権の告知が、街じゅうの掲示板に貼られている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「準決勝、そして決勝。今季の続きを」",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その日、瓦礫を運んでいた竜が、大声を上げた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「額が出たぞ! 割れてない!」瓦礫の下から、古い額縁が一枚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "埃を払うと、手書きの字が現れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「設立趣意書」冒頭の一行を、声に出して読んだ。読みながら、手が少し震えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「当場は、物語を終えた者たちが、続きを生きるための場所である」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "広場が、静かになった。木槌の音が止み、誰もが額を見ていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終わった者たちが、続きを生きるための場所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それを、いちばん必要としている人たちが、いま、梁を担いでいる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "沈黙を破ったのは、剣士さんだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……ふむ。では、続きをやらねばのう」木槌の音が、再開した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "さっきより、速く、明るく。趣意書の一行は、その日のうちに街の合言葉になった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社の言う「資産管理」は、趣意書の一行の上に、後から被さった運用にすぎない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "原本は、こう言っている。闘技場は倉庫じゃなく、続きのための場所だと。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "額は、正面玄関のいちばん目立つ壁に掛けることが、即決された。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "祭りの準備は、そのまま加速した。土産物屋が勝手に復興記念商品を作った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "正規ライセンス窓口と、大人げない縄張り争いを始めた。うちのチーム、いつの間に商品に。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕方、組み合わせが発表された。準決勝の相手は——カシム・ベル。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "完璧な窓口業務で知られる、あの受付の伝説。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "勝てば決勝。決勝の相手は、空の王者・シャハル。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "控室で、三人が組み合わせ表を囲んでいた。誰も、何も言わない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "指先の封が、こつ、こつ、と鳴る。耳も、そわそわしていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "特訓の続きが、したくてたまらない音だ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "白かった予定表に、二つの枠を書き込んだ。「準決勝」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「決勝」書き終えて、額の一行を思い出す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w23.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "続きを生きるための場所。うちの続きは、この二枠だ。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w23.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
